  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tony Waite Enterprise Linkage Fishing Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fish sector, Beneficries 386 Men and 311 Women. The group seeks to diversify their product offering to the market to include fresh frozen kapenta and fish breams through the strengthening of the cold chain system by purchasing solar powered blast freezer, freezer and a refridgerated truck. Establishment of a revovling purchase fund for the breams will increase supplies to the market. Support with fishing equipment enhances kapenta fishing. TRaining in enterprise management, business planning, monitoring and evaluation will further strengthen the enterprise.</narrative>
  </description>
